# The language's vocabulary, one word per line.
# Bangla (Bengali script) vocabulary, one word per line.
# No GPL-3.0-compatible Hunspell dictionary exists for bn: wooorm/dictionaries
# ships none, and LibreOffice's bn_BD is GPL-2.0-only (bare COPYING, no 'or
# later' grant) so it cannot be copied into this GPL-3.0-or-later repo. Built
# instead the way hi/word.lst was: every token of the other bn files, both
# halves of misspelling.lst included, plus hand-authored common vocabulary.
-
